# Hawai'i Climate Data Portal API token.
#
# Used only by `npm run prepare-story`, never by the browser: the rasters it
# fetches are baked into public/stories/ at build time and served from our own
# site. Nothing here reaches a visitor.
#
# Request one at https://www.hawaii.edu/climate-data-portal/hcdp-hawaii-mesonet-api/
VITE_MESONET_API_KEY=
